---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = 'July 18, 2026';
const discord = 'https://discord.gg/Q5DmJDZFVR';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How the Fallen World in-game chat handles your information."
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <div class="mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-500">Legal</div>
    <h1 class="mb-2 text-4xl font-extrabold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="mb-12 text-sm text-gray-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="space-y-10 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
      <p>
        This policy explains how the Fallen World in-game chat (the "Chat") handles your information. It
        applies to the Chat feature provided through our Fallout 4 mods and the chat service at
        chat.fallenworld.nexus. It does not cover Nexus Mods, Discord, or any other third-party service,
        each of which has its own privacy policy.
      </p>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">The chat is public</h2>
        <p>
          The Chat is a public, global chat. Every message you send is shown to all other players
          connected in-game and is mirrored to our Discord server, where it may be visible to the public.
          Please do not share personal, private, or sensitive information in the Chat.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">What we collect</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">When you use the Chat, we process:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 marker:text-emerald-500">
          <li>Messages you send, including their text and any commands.</li>
          <li>Your display name, which you choose and can change at any time.</li>
          <li>
            A randomly generated ID created on your device the first time you use the Chat. It is not
            linked to your real identity and is used to apply moderation actions consistently.
          </li>
          <li>A per-installation key used to recognise legitimate copies of the mod and prevent abuse.</li>
          <li>Connection details, including your IP address, recorded by our server.</li>
          <li>
            Your in-game location, meaning your character's location within Fallout 4 and not your
            real-world location, is sent with each message. It is not stored or shown to anyone.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Why we use it</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">We use this information only to operate and protect the Chat:</p>
        <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 marker:text-emerald-500">
          <li>Delivering your messages to other players and to our Discord server.</li>
          <li>
            Moderation and enforcement, such as removing banned users, filtering prohibited content, and
            preventing impersonation of staff.
          </li>
          <li>
            Abuse prevention, such as blocking spam, floods, and connections from proxies or VPNs used to
            evade bans.
          </li>
        </ul>
        <p class="mt-4">
          We do not use it for advertising, profiling, or analytics, and we never sell or rent it.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Where it is stored</h2>
        <p>
          Chat data is processed and stored on the FallenWorld chat server, which we operate. It is not
          stored on Nexus Mods. Your randomly generated ID and chat preferences are also saved locally on
          your own device.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Sharing</h2>
        <p>
          Messages are mirrored to our Discord server as part of the public chat.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          To prevent ban evasion, your IP address is checked against a third-party service that identifies
          proxies, VPNs, and known sources of abuse. Only your IP address is sent, never your messages,
          display name, or ID. We can tell you which provider we use on request.
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">
          Aside from the above, we do not share your information with third parties, except where we are
          required to by law. Your IP address is kept on our server for moderation and firewall purposes and
          is not shown in public channels or Discord alerts.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          Recent messages are kept briefly so newcomers can see the latest activity, then discarded. Raw
          connection logs, including IP addresses, are kept for up to 30 days and then automatically deleted.
          After that, we retain only the records needed to enforce moderation, such as the IDs of banned or
          restricted accounts and blocked names. We do not use any of this data for advertising, profiling,
          or tracking you across other services.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Your choices</h2>
        <p>
          Taking part in the Chat is optional. If you decline the notice shown when you first open the
          Chat, you will not connect and no chat data is sent. You can change your display name at any time.
          If you would like us to review or remove data associated with you, contact us using the details
          below and we will do our best to help.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Children</h2>
        <p>
          The Chat is not intended for anyone below the age at which they can consent to data processing in
          their country. Please do not use it if you are under that age.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tight text-white">Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions or requests about this policy can be sent to us on our
          <a href={discord} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="font-semibold text-emerald-400 hover:text-emerald-300">Discord server</a>.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
